<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Through the desert land of sin I roam no more,</l><l>For I find a living Spring</l><l>And my cup of gladness now is running o’er,</l><l>Jesus is my Lord and King.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here is sweet contentment as the days go by,</l><l>Here is holy peace and rest;</l><l>Here is consolation as the moments fly,</l><l>Here my heart is always blest.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Here I find a never ending, sure supply,</l><l>While the endless ages roll;</l><l>To this healing Fountain I would ever fly,</l><l>There to bathe my weary soul.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
